  message: "Phase 3 in progress. PR #3481 landed the dst-kind leakage subset (6 producers + 14 test files, awaits_bakeoff_validation). Three follow-up items now track the remaining subsets — keeping this item open until all three land:\n\n- WI-mifor-vabul (bridge/FFI subset) — needs bridge_kind enumeration design\n- WI-fugun-butil (IPC family audit) — gates IPC subset migration; analogous to ADR-0025\n- WI-vasik-jofiv (publish/dispatch subset) — verdicts landed in ADR-0025; mechanical execution\n\nAcceptance ('every endpoint_shape value has zero production emit sites') is partially met — the dst-kind subset is at zero emit sites. Bridge/FFI, IPC, and publish/dispatch endpoint_shape values still emit; this item closes when those subsets do.\n\nThe migration pattern PR #3481 established (replace_all in tests + Phase-2-shape consumer rewrite for any linker that filters by the deprecated edge_type) is reusable across subsets."  # b1a0
