  message: "Bridge/FFI subset done in PR #3483 (closes WI-mifor-vabul). Phase 3 progress now covers two of three deferred subsets:\n- dst-kind leakage (PR #3481)\n- bridge/FFI (PR #3483) — bonus fold of wasm_load → imports\n\nRemaining open subsets blocking 'every endpoint_shape value has zero production emit sites' acceptance:\n- WI-fugun-butil — IPC family audit (analogous to ADR-0025); this has to land before IPC family producer migration since canonical names aren't settled yet (ipc_calls, ipc_event, message_send/receive, websocket_*, message_queue, base_image, kernel_launch, script_src — wider than just 'IPC' depending on the audit's scope decision).\n- WI-vasik-jofiv — publish/dispatch family producer migration per ADR-0025.\n\nOnce both land, this item closes."  # bdb7
