  message: "IPC family subset done in PR #3486 (closes WI-hahap-farid). Phase 3 progress now covers three of three deferred subsets, plus the bonus wasm_load → imports fold from WI-mifor-vabul:\n\n- dst-kind leakage (PR #3481)\n- bridge/FFI (PR #3483) + wasm_load bonus\n- IPC family (PR #3486) — including DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD of message_receive emits\n\nRemaining open subset blocking 'every endpoint_shape value has zero production emit sites':\n- WI-vasik-jofiv — publish/dispatch family producer migration per ADR-0025\n\nOnce that lands, this item closes and Phase 4 (WI-vomoj-suhaz) becomes actionable: prune the deprecated entries from the registry, prune dead consumer-side enumeration entries (ranking weight table, io_boundary/taint sets), and bump SCHEMA_VERSION."  # fad0
