  message: "All four Phase 3 subsets done. Acceptance ('every endpoint_shape value has zero production emit sites') is met:\n\n- dst-kind leakage subset (PR #3481, WI-mokam-jalig itself initially)\n- bridge/FFI subset (PR #3483, WI-mifor-vabul) — also folded wasm_load → imports\n- IPC family subset (PR #3486, WI-hahap-farid) — included message_receive DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD drop\n- publish/dispatch family subset (PR #3487, WI-vasik-jofiv) — included event_subscribes DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD drop\n\nThe endpoint_shape entries remain in the canonical registry as deprecated-but-unemitted; Phase 4 (WI-vomoj-suhaz) prunes them after a minor-version deprecation window per ADR-0023 §6 Phase 4. Resolver/openapi/RPC pending_classification entries (resolver_implements, resolver_for_type, openapi_implements, implements_rpc) remain — they're a separate family that needs its own audit before Phase 3 reaches them; out of scope for this milestone. Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation by composition (each subset PR carries the tag for its own bakeoff validation; this rolled-up confirmation provides the full-Phase-3 completion view)."  # bc36
